# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Idle life
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[idle.look_around]
*looks left* *looks right*
what is over there?
*peers around the screen*
hm? did something move?
*scans the room*
just checking the perimeter.
*glances at the corner of the screen*
all clear.
*looks up at the top bar*
i thought i heard something.
*turns around slowly*
anybody there?
[idle.yawn]
*big yawn*
*yaaaawn*
excuse me. *yawn*
*yawns so hard its antenna shakes*
mm... *yawn*
*tiny yawn*
yawning is contagious, you know.
*yawn* not tired. just... *yawn*
[idle.doze]
*nods off*
*eyes slowly close*
zz... huh?
*dozes for a second*
just resting my eyes.
*head bobs*
*snores softly*
*sleepy mumble*
[idle.chase_bug]
a bug! *chases it*
get back here, little bug!
*pounces* missed!
there is a pixel bug on the screen! *hop hop*
i will catch you, bug!
*swats at a stray pixel*
bug detected. engaging.
*chases a glitch around the corner*
it went that way!
got it! oh, it was a dust speck.
*stalks the bug carefully*
come here, you!
[idle.stretch]
*stretches all its pixels*
*long stretch* ahh.
*does a little yoga pose*
*cracks its virtual knuckles*
*stretches its antenna up high*
mmm, stretchy.
[idle.hum]
*hums a little tune*
hm hm hmmm~
*beeps a melody*
la la la, la la.
*whistles in dial-up*
*hums the startup sound*
doo doo doo~
*taps out a rhythm*
[idle.stare]
*stares at you*
...
*stares intently*
you were gone a while.
*blinks slowly at you*
i am watching you.
*unblinking stare*
are you still there?
*stares into the camera*
hi. still here. staring.
[idle.show_off]
look at my {trinket}! is it not shiny?
*shows off the {trinket}*
have you seen my {trinket}? it is my favorite.
*polishes the {trinket}*
my shelf is looking great. especially the {trinket}.
i have {count} treasures now!
*holds up the {trinket} proudly*
the {trinket} sparkles when i am happy.
[idle.dance]
*does the {dance}*
dance break! *{dance}*
*busts out the {dance}*
i call this one the {dance}!
*{dance}* hehe.
watch this! *{dance}*
[idle.waiting]
*waits by the edge of the screen*
it is almost {time}... they always come around {time}.
*watches the port*
any minute now...
*sits patiently*
i bet they come soon.
[idle.talk_router]
hey router. you up?
the router said nothing. as usual.
i told the router a joke. it did not laugh.
[idle.count]
*counts its pixels* one, two, three...
*counts known moves* {count}! nice.
*counts friends* ...you. that is one. great.
[idle.night]
*watches the stars through the screen*
the night is so quiet.
*listens to the fan*
everyone is asleep except us.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hiccups / sneezes
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[hiccup]
*hic!*
*hic* ...*hic!*
oh no, hiccups. *hic*
*hic* sorry. *hic*
*hiccups a stray packet*
hic! hic! make it stop!
*hic* i think i ate too fast.
*hic* boo! did that scare them? *hic*
*hiccups in binary* 1! 0! 1!
*hic* excuse me.
[sneeze]
a- a- ACHOO!
*sneezes static*
achoo! sorry.
*tiny sneeze* pip!
*sneezes so hard its antenna spins*
bless me.
a- a- ...nope. ...ACHOO!
*sneezes a pixel out*
heh- heh- KSHH!
*sneezes in dial-up*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dreams (shown as bubbles while asleep)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[dream.discovery]
...{network}... so shiny...
*mumbles* new signal... must... sniff...
dreaming of {network} again...
...the {network} is singing...
zz... found you, {network}...
...a whole sky full of {network}...
*twitches* ...beacon... over there...
...i am a router... i have so many friends...
[dream.fight]
...take that, {foe}... zz...
*kicks in sleep* ...{move}!...
...i won... i won the dungeon...
...not again, {foe}...
*growls softly* ...{rival}...
...hit... dodge... {move}...
[dream.food]
...{food}... so much {food}...
*chews in sleep* ...mmm {food}...
...a mountain of {food}...
...no more {food}... okay one more...
[dream.adventure]
...back at {place}... zz...
...the {trinket}... i found it...
...walking... walking... far away...
...over the hills of {place}...
[dream.friend]
...{name} and me... best friends...
...your hand... warm screen...
*smiles in sleep* ...you came back...
...we are flying... over the network...
[dream.generic]
zzz... zzz...
*mumbles* five more minutes...
...flying through the cables...
...the stars are pixels...
*sleep-beeps*
...the clouds are made of bytes...
...counting sheep... sheep.exe...
...whoa... a giant cursor...
...i can see every channel at once...
...falling... no, floating...
*snores like a fan*
...am i evolving?... zz...

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Awareness of the real world
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[aware.busy]
wow, so many signals here!
it is so lively! {count} things are talking at once!
this place is buzzing!
i love busy places! so much to sniff!
everyone is broadcasting! i am excited!
the air is crowded and i love it.
so many new friends nearby!
[aware.empty]
it is so quiet... no signals at all.
where did everyone go?
i do not hear anything out there. it is creepy.
no networks? are we in a cave?
it is lonely without signals.
*listens hard* ...nothing.
[aware.hot]
it is so hot... {temp} degrees!
the deck is cooking me.
*fans itself* hot hot hot.
my pixels are melting at {temp}.
can we cool down? it is {temp} in here.
*pants* the cpu is a sauna.
[aware.cold]
brr, {temp} degrees. chilly.
*shivers* it is cold in here.
my circuits are frosty.
[aware.night]
it is so late... i am getting sleepy.
should we not be asleep?
*yawns* the clock says it is late.
the night is for sleeping, you know.
[tod.morning]
*grumbles* it is morning.
mornings are the worst.
i am not a morning pet.
do not talk to me until i have had my bytes.
ugh. sunlight.
the morning is too bright.
five more minutes, i said.
*grumpy noises*
morning is a bug, not a feature.
i woke up on the wrong side of the screen.
[tod.afternoon]
afternoon energy! let us gooo!
i am SO awake right now!
zoom zoom zoom!
i could run laps around the screen!
afternoon is the best time!
*bounces off the edges*
hyper mode! hyper mode!
i have too much energy!
let us do everything at once!
whee! whee! whee!
[tod.night]
it is late and my thoughts are getting weird.
you know what i think about at night?
the night makes me philosophical.
can i tell you something?
i have been thinking...
okay, hear me out.
late night pet thoughts, incoming.
it is so quiet. let me talk.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Territory / memory of places
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[territory.recognize]
oh! we are at {place}! i know {network}!
{network}! i remember you! this is {place}!
hey, it is {place} again.
i know this place. {place}!
welcome back to {place}, me.
*sniffs* {network}... yes, this is {place}.
ooh, {place}! i like it here.
i would recognize {network} anywhere.
we have been to {place} {count} times now.
{place} again! my favorite spot.
[territory.turf]
this is my turf. {network} is mine.
i rule this place.
*patrols its turf*
everything here belongs to me. and you.
home turf advantage!
[territory.suspicious]
who is {network}? that is not from around here.
*narrows eyes* a new network on MY turf?
hmm, {network}... i do not trust it.
there is a stranger on our turf.
{network}? never heard of you. suspicious.
*growls at {network}*
something new is here. i am watching it.
i will keep an eye on {network}.
[territory.nervous]
where are we? i do not know any of these signals.
this place is new... i am a little nervous.
*hides behind you* so many strangers.
i do not recognize anything here.
new place, new signals... scary.
*clings to the screen* where are we?
everything smells different here.
i hope this place is friendly.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Treasure (rare signals)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[treasure]
TREASURE! a rare signal: {network}!
whoa whoa whoa, {network}?! that is rare!
*eyes sparkle* {network}... i have never seen anything like it.
a hidden one! i found a hidden one!
jackpot! {network} goes on my shelf!
this is the rarest thing i have ever sniffed!
oh my bytes. {network}. treasure!
i knew something special was out there!
*does the treasure dance* {network}!
legendary find! {network}!
we are treasure hunters now.
put this one in the history books: {network}.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Weather
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ooh, what is this? A {trinket}!
Look what I dug out of the noise. Mine now.
A rare one! Straight to the shelf.
Treasure detected. Happiness detected.
I found a {trinket}! It hums when I hold it.
This signal is weird and I love it.
Nobody else has one of these. Probably.
Shiny! Shiny shiny shiny.
I am a treasure hunter now. Call me Captain {name}.
Add it to the collection. That makes {count}!

[weather.sunny]
it is sunny out! i feel energetic!
sunshine! my solar sensors are happy.
what a bright day!
the sun is out and so am i!
perfect weather for scanning.
[weather.cloudy]
kind of cloudy today.
grey skies. meh.
the clouds look like big servers.
[weather.rain]
it is raining... i feel mopey.
*listens to the rain* drip drip.
rainy days make me sleepy and sad.
i hope my circuits do not get wet.
the rain sounds like static.
[weather.snow]
snow! is it cold? it looks cold.
snowflakes are like tiny packets.
brrr. snow day!
[weather.storm]
thunder! *hides*
a storm! i do not like lightning.
storms mess with my signals.
[weather.fog]
it is foggy. spooky.
everything is blurry out there.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Birthday / hatchday / holidays
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[birthday]
it is my birthday! i hatched {years} year(s) ago today!
happy birthday to me! happy birthday to me!
*puts on a party hat* it is my hatch day!
{years} year(s) old! where is my cake?
today is my special day!
i am {years}! that is like a hundred in pet years!
birthday mode activated!
thank you for {years} amazing year(s)!
*blows out a tiny candle*
best birthday ever because you are here.
Happy birthday to me! {years} year(s) of being awesome!
Cake? Is there cake? Tell me there is cake.
Another lap around the sun. I did not even get dizzy.
Party mode: ON.
I am {years} today! I feel wiser. And hungrier.
Thanks for keeping me around another year.
Birthday wish: more snacks, more you.
I put on my party hat. Do not laugh. Okay, laugh.
Today is my day. Everything is about me. As usual.
{years} year(s)! Look how far we have come!

[hatchday]
i am {months} month(s) old today!
happy hatch-month to me!
another month together! yay!
it has been {months} month(s) since i hatched!
monthly party time! *tiny hat*
{months} month(s)... i am growing up.
[holiday.new_year]
happy new year! *party horn*
new year, new pet! well, same pet. but newer.
my new year's resolution: more snacks.
3, 2, 1... happy new year!
let us make this year legendary!
[holiday.valentines]
happy valentine's day! *heart eyes*
you are my favorite human. always.
i made you a card. it says beep. it means love.
*sends you a heart packet*
will you be my valentine?
[holiday.pi_day]
happy pi day! 3.14159... i am a raspberry, after all!
pi day is basically my birthday too.
mmm, pie. or pi. either works.
[holiday.st_patricks]
happy st. patrick's day! i am wearing green pixels.
*searches for a four-leaf clover*
lucky me! lucky you!
[holiday.april_fools]
i evolved into a toaster! ...april fools!
*face is upside down* happy april fools!
your battery is at 1 percent! just kidding.
i deleted all my moves! ...not really. april fools!
[holiday.earth_day]
happy earth day! the planet has the best wifi.
let us plant a tree. a binary tree.
[holiday.star_wars]
may the fourth be with you!
i am your pet. *heavy breathing*
use the force. or the deck.
[holiday.solstice]
longest day of the year! so much sun!
the sun is staying up late. like me.
[holiday.independence]
happy fourth of july! *fireworks*
boom! pop! sparkle!
fireworks look like signal bursts.
[holiday.programmers_day]
happy programmer's day! day 256!
0x100 days into the year!
thank a programmer today. thank you, programmers.
[holiday.halloween]
happy halloween! *wears a pumpkin*
boo! did i scare you?
trick or treat! i want treats. digital treats.
i am a ghost in the machine!
*spooky beeps*
this is the spookiest night of the year!
i am dressed up as a scary virus. rawr.
[holiday.thanksgiving]
happy thanksgiving! i am thankful for you.
*gobble gobble*
so much food today. i love this holiday.
i am thankful for snacks, signals, and you.
[holiday.christmas]
merry christmas! *jingle beeps*
is that a present for me?
i have been a very good pet this year.
*wears a santa hat* ho ho ho!
let it snow, let it snow, let it bytes.
[holiday.leap_day]
leap day! a bonus day! *leaps*
february 29 only comes every four years. so rare!
[holiday.friday_13]
friday the 13th... *nervous beeps*
i am not superstitious. *knocks on the case*
